  "pr": {
    "body": "The integration baseline fails because `leadership-rotation-science` imports `engine/rates_command_basis.py` through the yield-momentum dependency chain, while its exclusive CI path scope omits that file. Add that exact dependency so edits to the rates basis select the science job and the curated import-closure guard passes. All other job fields and path sets remain unchanged.\n\nThis is a one-line CI declaration repair for baseline 38565061444, which is blocking final Fable records #9303. It changes no engine, test assertion, controller, capacity limit or runtime. The scoped claim is recorded on #9293, comment6169011590.\n\nValidation: parent reproduced the exact missing-path failure at `b4a515dcbab3`; the repaired declaration has parsed parity with current main `a1f24caf824b` apart from the one added path. The repaired source passed both existing checks: `test_curated_exclusive_scopes_cover_their_own_import_closure` and `test_exclusive_curation_narrows_ordinary_code_prs` (2 passed, 0 failed, 646.74s). `git diff --check` and complete parsed-manifest parity also pass. The original RED and normal-routed Fabric census are retained; parent review rejected the census's mistaken claim that an older ancestor was newer main.\n\nProtected CI and the incumbent main-red-repair/controller gates remain required. No manual merge, force refresh, baseline dispatch or runtime deployment is part of this repair.\n",
